  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760371,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Dive into an underwater adventure and then soar into action with *2 Games in 1 – Buscando a Nemo + Los Increibles* for the Game Boy Advance! This dual-game cartridge brings together two beloved Pixar classics in a single, portable package.\n\nFirst, experience the heartwarming journey of *Buscando a Nemo*. Play as Marlin, a timid clownfish, as you navigate vibrant coral reefs and treacherous ocean currents to find your lost son, Nemo. Solve puzzles, evade predators like sharks and jellyfish, and befriend quirky characters like Dory to overcome obstacles. The gameplay focuses on exploration, timed jumps, and simple platforming.\n\nThen, switch gears and become a superhero with *Los Increibles*! Join Bob, Helen, Violet, Dash, and Jack-Jack as they battle villains and uncover a sinister conspiracy. This action-packed adventure features side-scrolling gameplay where you control each member of the Parr family, utilizing their unique superpowers to defeat enemies and solve puzzles. Expect fast-paced combat, exciting boss battles, and a thrilling storyline that captures the spirit of the film. A perfect blend of heartwarming and heroic fun!"
    },
